  "interpretation": "Phase 43 implements velocity-dependent gravothermal SIDM using Yang+ 2022's velocity-weighted cross section sigma_eff. This replaces the constant-sigma/m assumption in Phase 41D.\n\nKey insight: sigma_eff weights sigma(v) by v^5 * f(v), giving more weight to higher-velocity scatterings. For our multi-resonant sigma/m(v), this means the effective cross-section depends on the local velocity dispersion."
